# Behavioural verification: tapping a climb card opens the climb-detail
# screen, NOT a setter-detail screen. The PERF NAV markers are emitted
# by BoardBrowserScreen + BoardClimbDetailViewModel + BoardClimbDetailScreen,
# all of which fire only on the ClimbDetail path. SetterDetail does not
# emit any of these markers.

🧭 NAV START: BoardBrowser → ClimbDetail\(
🧭 .*BOARD_CLIMB_DETAIL composable entered
🧭 .*BoardClimbDetailVM\.init start
🧭 .*loadClimb start
🧭 .*loadClimb complete
🧭 .*NAV COMPLETE: BoardClimbDetail\(
